{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國務院周五（10月30日）表示，已批准向烏克蘭出售500枚「愛國者」PAC-3導彈，估計總值21億美元（約164億港元）。</p><p>這將是特朗普第二屆政府上台以來，向基輔提供防禦武器的最重大舉措之一。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.754718+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T00:52:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.059881+00:00","content_hash":"f8a4e9ff43ef2b59be6130efa3b2f58cc14397621ee25fc18b2383b45b32dd83","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}